 the dungeons.<br>Rare pieces of equipment may also come with unique skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local co-op mode</h2>You can connect two gamepads to one PC and play co-op with your friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades at your base</h2>You can unlock new skills<br>and upgrade weapons in the village that acts as your base.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A cursed kingdom</h2>You cannot leave the kingdom at the center of this story<br>as it has been cursed by the queen.<br>Clear the dungeon and solve the mystery of the curse placed on the kingdom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world created in pixel art</h2>The world featured in this game has a nostalgic feel to it<br>owing to the pixel-art style.","developers":["Shinobi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1321010/header.jpg?t=1625008279","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Catalina 10.15.7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1321010/312914/4457602ecee2085def48395ec2b0511ea064a2c4/1751221444/dash_av1.mpd?t=1606384524","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1321010/312914/4457602ecee2085def48395ec2b0511ea064a2c4/1751221444/dash_h264.mpd?t=1606384524","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1321010/312914/4457602ecee2085def48395ec2b0511ea064a2c4/1751221444/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1606384524","id":256801379,"name":"LabyrinthLegendPV_en","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256801379/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1606384524"}],"name":"Labyrinth Legend